    "Each table's levels are stretched linearly onto its band (fishing starts 5 lower).",
    "Species then evolve through EVO_LEVEL evolutions the new minimum level has reached.",
    "rules: prefix -> {day: [ops], night: [ops]}. A night table is built from the original",
