    "ops: {swap: {SPECIES_A: SPECIES_B}} or {type: land_mons, slots: [i, ...], species: SPECIES_X}.",
    "Part 33: Ralts (102), Tropius (119) and Absol (119, 120) are swapped out of the day and night",
    "tables; each comes only from its own event (data/hoenn/distribution.json)."
